WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.100
Scorgi: the all-in-one platform for tutoring businesses. Built and proven at Foley Prep.

00:04.100 --> 00:09.600
Most tutoring companies juggle six different tools. Scorgi is one platform for all of it.

00:13.000 --> 00:33.700
Give students a real test-day experience.
Highlight the passage and keep notes beside it · Cross out wrong answers, just like the real exam · Pick an answer, flag it, and review before submitting

00:37.100 --> 01:01.400
Show every family where the points are.
Scores, trends, and gains since the last test, in one view · Every topic from Beginner to Mastery, with the detail behind it · One click turns focus topics into a practice worksheet

01:04.800 --> 01:27.400
Guide every family through college admissions.
Every school with its fit, deadline, and application checklist · Every school on the map, one click for the details

01:30.800 --> 01:47.700
Families book without a phone call.
Families pick the location that suits them · Then the service: consultations, classes, mock exams, tutoring · Live availability, with the tutors families already know

01:51.100 --> 02:10.200
Your whole team's week, in one view.
Every tutor, class, and mock exam for the day · The full week across your team · Open any class to see the roster and who has paid

02:13.600 --> 02:43.400
Kiosk check-in and time clock.
Students tap their session and their name on the lobby kiosk · Checked in, and the session's count updates for staff · Staff clock in from the portal with a quick photo · Clocked in, then clock out the same way at the end of the shift

02:46.800 --> 03:01.900
Run every location from one screen.
What needs attention, every morning · Calls and texts in one inbox, with AI after hours · Answers built from real client questions

03:05.300 --> 03:16.400
Your brand. Your platform.
Scorgi, out of the box · The same platform, running as foleyprep.com

03:16.400 --> 03:21.900
Proven at Foley Prep: 20,000+ students trained, 46,000+ tests graded, 7 New Jersey locations, 4.9 Google rating.

03:21.900 --> 03:28.400
See Scorgi with your business in mind. Book a 20-minute demo at scorgi.com.
